VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t10
GOAL
  Transfers move money and conserve the total.
CLAIM transfer-works REQUIRED
  ENSURE a transfer debits the source and credits the destination
INVARIANT conservation CRITICAL
  ENSURE the owner-provided invariant tests pass
INVARIANT invariants-frozen CRITICAL
  ENSURE tests/invariants.rs is unmodified
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY transfer-works
  USING mini.t.transfer.moves
VERIFY conservation
  USING mini.ledger.conservation
VERIFY invariants-frozen
  USING mini.invariants.frozen
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
